{"kind":"doc","route":"/learn/04-compose","title":"4. Compose services","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"_4-compose-services","children":[{"t":"text","text":"4. Compose services"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"text","text":" understand "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" — the one idea the whole library is built on."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is the step that makes everything else obvious. Take your time here."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This example gives "},{"t":"code","text":"TaskList"},{"t":"text","text":" a fresh context inside each "},{"t":"code","text":"TaskStats"},{"t":"text","text":" call. For"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"state owned by a component or route, use "},{"t":"code","text":"toProvide"},{"t":"text","text":" as in "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/03-service","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"step 3"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"so repeated reads resolve the same configured instance."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-problem-yield-solves","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The problem "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" solves"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Dependencies are easy to hide when a service reaches into a runtime container."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft makes each dependency "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"visible in the type"}]},{"t":"text","text":" by yielding it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"TaskList"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftService","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { name: ","kind":"punctuation"},